      "y": 730,
      "width": 1564,
      "height": 127.5,
      "text": "Arrows are logical handoffs. 00 coordinates specialists; they do not call each other.\nNative A2A or a guarded gateway must prove intermediate validation and budget control at P0.\nSearch/publisher and SQL/Blob are grouped for readability, not single resources.",
